    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Check AI Against the Docs\r\n\r\nAI can help you understand API documentation, but it doesn't always describe a specific API accurately. In this level, you'll find out for yourself.\r\n\r\n#### Do This:\r\n1. Upload the API documentation PDF to AI Chat from the library.\r\n2. Ask AI Chat how you request weather information about a specific location using the OpenWeather API.\r\n3. Read AI's response. \r\n4. Open the OpenWeather API documentation [here](https://drive.google.com/file/d/14YM40Rev-of7TaPwllaDE7-QvJMI-AgM/view?usp=drive_link) and compare it to what AI said.\r\n5. Head back to your activity guide and discuss with your neighber.\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
